DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261004
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
X-MICROSOFT-MSNCALENDAR-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
SUMMARY:20s/30s Wachusett Hike & Social
LOCATION:Princeton\, MA
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, October 4\, 2026 | 7:30 AM\nhttps://activities.outdoo
 rs.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001JVlt2AG/\nJoin the Worcester 20s and 30s f
 or a morning hike at Wachusett Mountain\, followed by a nearby social acti
 vity after the hike. This hike follows one of the more relaxed routes up W
 achusett Mountain\, with a mix of service roads and trail paths up to the 
 summit. Given the timing of the hike\, please plan to dress for the fall m
 orning weather\, as temperatures may be colder at the start of the hike. T
 he planned route is a little under four miles with under 1000 feet of elev
 ation gain. We plan to take around three hours up and back\, which gives u
 s plenty of time to get up and down with a short break at the top at a mod
 erate pace.We recommend bringing:At least one liter of waterSnacksSuitable
  clothes for the weather and hiking conditionsAppropriate footwear for tra
 il environmentsHiking poles (optional)Funds for the post-hike activityPark
 ing and post-hike activity information will be shared with confirmed parti
 cipants once the trip survey is complete. 
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
