SUMMARY:20s & 30s Renaissance Festival Social
LOCATION:Parking lot\, 5 Pine S\nCarver\, MA 02330
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 10\, 2026 | 11:00 AM\nhttps://activities.ou
 tdoors.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001FiWP2A0/\nTHERE IS A BUG WITH REGISTRA
 TION. IF YOU CANNOT REGISTER FOR THIS SOCIAL\, EMAIL ROB at ROBRAFGON@GMAI
 L.COM.Hear ye! Hear ye! Embraceth adventure and occasions of socialization
  most joyous!WE'RE GOING TO THE RENAISSANCE FESTIVAL\, PEASANTS!!! WOOOO-E
 TH!!!If you're looking at this and going\, "wasn't this a camping trip?" Y
 es\, it was. Now it's not. Rain rain did not go away and in fact came thos
 e specific days. Good news\, the Ren Fest is around for a few more weekend
 s. Bad news\, the campground is closed for the season. So for our rain dat
 e ren-fest action\, it's just a day long social.Join your fellow 20s & 30s
  for a Ren-Fest camp out Social on October 10!20s & 30s folx from any chap
 ter are welcome to join us on this jaunt\, fealty to the Worcester Chapter
  is not a pre-requisite.Several items of note:You must secure your own tic
 ket to King Richard's Faire\, we're not buying for you! Purchase at www.ki
 ngrichardsfaire.net.Costumes for the King Richard's Faire are encouraged b
 ut not required. If you'd like to borrow or need some tips\, your fearless
  leader is a massive nerd and can offer budget friendly recommendations.To
  best accommodate coordination\, plan on being out at the fest for the who
 le day
END:VEVENT
